            "detailed_description": "This simulation transports you to the varied work in road construction. Re-enact typical assignments and scenarios on country roads and motorways. Get to work with the asphalt mill, steamroller, marking machine and many more special vehicles.<br><br>Build a new section of motorway, widen lanes and renew the road surface. Use tools like the jack hammer and secure the site with barriers. Includes detailed vehicles and a range of camera angles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Diverse assignments like building a section of motorway, renewing the road surface and widening lanes<br></li><li>Lovingly detailed vehicles and different camera angles<br></li><li>Challenging assignments ranging from standard road repairs to building an airport road<br></li><li>Choose from lots of special vehicles: marking machine, steamroller, excavator</li></ul>",
